Before publishing your **Rai Plus / Virat Student 360° Website, School ERP and Mobile Application**, you should conduct a complete pre-launch audit covering security, functionality, performance, database integrity, user experience, compatibility and business operations.

Since your objective is to launch this as a **commercial, multi-school SaaS platform**, testing must go beyond checking whether buttons and pages work. You must ensure that one school's data can never be accessed by another school, student information remains protected, and the application can handle real-world school operations.

Below is a comprehensive **Pre-Launch Quality Assurance (QA), Security & Testing Master Checklist** that you can give to your AI development team.

